      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;How many syntax issues are there in the following code, and what are they?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;import (&#xA;    &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#xA;)&#xA;func main() {&#xA;    var x string = nil&#xA;    if x == nil {&#xA;        x = &amp;#34;default&amp;#34;&#xA;    }&#xA;    fmt.Println(x)&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;var x string = nil&lt;/code&gt;&#xA;A string cannot be &lt;code&gt;nil&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;if x == nil {&lt;/code&gt;&#xA;A string cannot be compared with &lt;code&gt;nil&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 063</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_063/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:44:45 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_063/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;func main() {  &#xA;    i := 65&#xA;    fmt.Println(string(i))&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A. A&#xA;B. 65&#xA;C. compilation error&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;A&#xA;In UTF-8 encoding, the decimal number 65 corresponds to the symbol &amp;lsquo;A&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 057</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_057/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:44:38 +0800</pubDate>
